{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlackoutTonight</strong> is a story-driven side-scrolling puzzle game. You'll become Xiao Lan, the building's most promising detective, and must investigate the truth behind the stormy night's power outage before midnight to restore electricity\u2014so you can have food tomorrow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Details to Experience</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring ambiguous supernatural elements, plenty of useful (and useless) interactive clues, and neighbors with distinct personalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartwarming Daily Stories</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate every item through point-and-click mechanics, question NPCs, discover clues, and uncover the heartwarming daily lives of the protagonist and NPCs through gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Different Side Stories</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your attention to detail and wisdom (or the save system) to solve the problems you discover, influence the residents' lives, and unlock different ending CGs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite-Sized Relaxing Experience</strong> With a 1-2 hour main storyline, hand-drawn cute art style, and carefully crafted music, enjoy a light and pleasant gaming experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Don't rush.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5f00\u9501\u521d\u5b66\u8005","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3366360/7ba2911403ca0e9acc72705af42c719973f8e755.jpg"},{"name":"\u6709\u7535\u5371\u9669","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3366360/8d51e8ba80d73715bc8f71f953d8ecc746f73fd0.jpg"},{"name":"\u5305\u6708\u5957\u9910","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3366360/dae8c1195c87e832c04b7228be72e0fce6747a5d.jpg"},{"name":"\u8c08\u5224\u4e13\